symmetry of x^3 - 3x^2:
  neither even nor odd
  not even: f(x) = -2, f(-x) = -4 at x = 1
  not odd: f(x) = -2, f(-x) = -4 at x = 1
  checked numerically at 2000 points of [-10, 10]
  point symmetric about (1, -2): f(c + h) + f(c - h) = 2 f(c) (checked numerically at 200 h up to 10)
