> asymptotes 1/(x - 1)
asymptotes of 1/(x - 1):
  vertical: x = 1 (f -> -inf from the left, +inf from the right)
  horizontal: y = 0 as x -> ±inf
  proved symbolically: f = N/D with deg N = 0, deg D = 1; poles are the real roots of D that are roots of N of lower multiplicity (others are holes); at infinity the quotient of N by D
