  vertical: x = 0 (f -> -inf from the left, +inf from the right)
  oblique: y = x as x -> ±inf
  proved symbolically: f = N/D with deg N = 2, deg D = 1; poles are the real roots of D that are roots of N of lower multiplicity (others are holes); at infinity the quotient of N by D
